Package: phr
Title: Public Health Resource Analysis Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Saeed",
           family = "Rahman",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "saeed.rahman0@gmail.com")
Description: Provides a suite of R6-based data classes, validation utilities,
    quality-control tests, and visualisation helpers for public health survey
    data.  Core functionality covers food security (FSL/FCS/HDDS/LCSI/RCSI),
    nutrition (MUAC, z-scores, IYCF), mortality, WASH, and demographics,
    together with standardised output schemas and a collection of ggplot2-based
    plot functions.
